## 7. Motion, accessibility, do / don't

- **Motion:** duration, reduced-motion fallback (replace springs/drifts with fades; keep the state change).
- **A11y:** WCAG 2.1 AA; 44 pt / 48 dp targets; contrast computed not eyeballed; screen-reader labels in the product language; never encode state by hue alone.
- **Do:** tokens only; one accent CTA per screen unless chrome is the exception.
- **Don't:** hex in components; mixed icon packs; invent mockups when `docs/design/` has a file for that screen.

